cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the kan_ft_ofl3 model or the Kannada OCR benchmark, please cite them as below."
title: "Kannada OCR: an open benchmark and a fine-tuned Tesseract model for printed Kannada"
abstract: "kan_ft_ofl3, a Tesseract 5 model for printed Kannada fine-tuned on Kannada Wikisource lines and synthetic lines rendered in openly licensed fonts, with a benchmark of 4 evaluation sets, a synthetic data pipeline and the training recipe. On a shared sample of 60 pre-1950 letterpress pages read with --psm 4, its character error rate is 6.0%, against 8.7% for Tesseract's stock kan model."
type: software
authors:
